invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: webpki_loop_tcp_nonblocking
reason: handle_ticket gives a ticket to an on_ticket that the caller set in
  the session after the init call. That init call wrote no
  ticket_config_hash, so the ticket is bound to the all-zero hash, and
  every init call that presents it answers CH_EINVAL (docs/decisions.md
  132). test/webpki_loop_tickets.h's check_late_on_ticket requires that no
  ticket is given.

--- old
    if (t->takes_tickets == 0) {
        return CH_OK;
    }
--- new
    (void)t->takes_tickets;
